# Gmail SMTP Configuration
# Replace these placeholder values with your actual Gmail credentials
# DO NOT commit this file with real credentials - only use .env.local for real values

GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-app-specific-password

# Note: Use Gmail App Passwords, not your regular Gmail password
# Generate one at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
